    "Type a bundle identifier (e.g. us.zoom.xos) to watch an app that isn't currently running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type a bundle identifier (e.g. us.zoom.xos) to watch an app that isn't currently running."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "현재 실행되지 않는 앱을 감시하려면 번들 식별자(예: us.zoom.xos)를 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在実行されていないアプリを監視するには、バンドル識別子(例: us.zoom.xos)を入力します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 bundle 标识符(例如 us.zoom.xos)以监控当前未运行的应用程序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輸入 bundle 識別碼(例如 us.zoom.xos)以監看目前未執行的應用程式。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escribe un identificador de paquete (p. ej. us.zoom.xos) para vigilar una app que no se esté ejecutando."
          }
        },
